    "99000000111": "Ah, a traveler! I'm Elias. I study the creatures that live around Prontera.",
    "99000000112": "How can I help?",
    "99000000113": "The Porings outside the South Gate have been acting strangely. Could you defeat ^{1}5 Porings^{2} so I can study the jelly they leave behind?",

    "99000000201": "Jelly Samples",
    "99000000202": "Defeat @{1} Porings at the Prontera South Gate for Elias",
    "99000000203": "Defeat Porings at the South Gate*",

    "99000000301": "Back to the Scholar",
    "99000000302": "Bring the jelly samples back to Elias in Prontera.",
    "99000000303": "Report to Elias in Prontera",
    "99000000311": "You're back already? This jelly is perfect. Thank you, adventurer. Please take this for your trouble."
